What is Body Lotion?
Body lotion is a topical skincare emulsion specifically designed to hydrate, soften, and protect the skin. These formulations combine occlusives, humectants, and emollients to help replenish the skin's natural moisture barrier, improve texture, and provide essential protection against environmental stressors. While traditionally a basic moisturizer, the modern body lotion market now includes products targeting specific skin types such as dry, oily, and normal skin, with many formulations offering additional benefits like anti-aging properties, sun protection, and firming capabilities.

